OL,3,GNEWSATax treaty to bolster investment
OL,4,Aand support jobs
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn agreement has been reached between
OL,7,FJersey and Oman to avoid the double
OL,8,Ftaxation of the same income, encourage
OL,9,Fnew investment and support jobs,
OL,10,Fofficials have said.
OL,12,FThe island's government said the
OL,13,FMinister for External Relations and
OL,14,FFinancial Services, Senator Ian Gorst
OL,15,Fsigned the treaty with the Sultanate of
OL,16,FOman in Muscat on Wednesday.
OL,18,FIt said the Double Taxation Agreement
OL,19,F(DTA) promised greater legal certainty
OL,20,Fon taxation between the two
OL,21,Fjurisdictions.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
